{"title":"Imp","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Imp that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=1\">Lv 1 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=2\">Lv 2 <span>70</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=2\" title=\"Pick level 2\"><td><b>2</b></td><td>14</td><td>2.2</td><td>100</td><td class=\"muted\">42 · 3.1 · 300</td><td>70</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"imp\" data-map-level=\"10\">Show level 10 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 19 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"imp\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/imp-burning\"><img src=\"data/img/e2fe5eea0b7203d0ef0d.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Imp Burning</b><span>Lv 12</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Imp: <a href=\"#/monster/baby-imp\">Baby Imp</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/e2fe5eea0b7203d0ef0d.webp\" alt=\"Imp\"></div><h3>Imp</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>10</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 1)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Imp</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>31</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>10</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>68 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}